sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    participant Client as Web or mobile
    participant API as Checkout API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Worker as Durable worker
    participant Provider as Payment provider
    Customer->>Client: Confirm variants and delivery
    Client->>API: Create quote with cart version
    API->>DB: Read current prices and policies
    DB-->>API: Validated pricing facts
    API-->>Client: Quote, totals, expiry, no stock hold
    Client->>API: Place order with quote and idempotency key
    rect rgb(235, 247, 240)
        API->>DB: BEGIN, claim key, lock quote and sorted balances
        API->>DB: Validate versions, reserve all lines
        alt Any validation or stock check fails
            API->>DB: ROLLBACK all effects
            API-->>Client: Conflict and actionable details
        else All checks pass
            API->>DB: Order, snapshots, reservations and outbox
            alt Cash on delivery
                API->>DB: Allocate stock, payment remains unpaid
            else Online method
                API->>DB: Create payment attempt and initialization task
            end
            API->>DB: Save safe replay response, COMMIT
            API-->>Client: Durable order ID and payment action state
        end
    end
    opt Online order committed
        Worker->>DB: Lease same payment initialization task
        Worker->>Provider: Initialize with stable operation reference
        Provider-->>Worker: Hosted action or unknown outcome
        Worker->>DB: Persist action or reconciliation task
        Client->>API: Fetch owned payment action
        API-->>Client: Allowlisted redirect or initializing state
    end
